Server less Compute


Challenges faced by classic compute
	-Wait time for classic compute is lot, 5-7 mins 
	-Need to choose many infra settings for performance /cost
	-Server less compute is simple, performant and maintenance free


	However in server less we can just pick a goal
	-standard mode
	-Performance mode
		Standard mode is some what similar to classic compute and has some wait time compared to performance mode.



In Classic compute:
Server -> infra + software

infra - Azure 
Software - Databricks

In Server less compute 
infra + Software -> Databricks


Classic compute runs in cloud account like azure
Server less compute runs in databricks i.e in control plane 


Server less compute will reduce the wait time and also scales automatically.
Server less is faster than classic compute.
There is no spark UI in server less as we don't have any dedicated server.
Server less compute charges mainly for the queries you run and for the sessions and not for the resources

Environment option is only for server less, available in the right plane
Memory in environment tab refers to the memory used for the session or notebook REPL.(Read Evaluate Print Load)
The notebook acts like REPL and this will communicate to the spark cluster using spark connect

Notebook REPL -> Spark connect -> Spark cluster.
